 will have + V3","S + won't have + V3","Will + S + have + V3?"],"use":"Sẽ hoàn tất trước một mốc tương lai","signals":"by + mốc tương lai, by the time, before","ex":["By 2030, I'll have finished my degree.","Đến năm 2030 tôi sẽ học xong."]},{"name":"Future perfect continuous","vi":"Tương lai hoàn thành tiếp diễn","point":"future-perfect","form":["S + will have been + V-ing","S + won't have been + V-ing","Will + S + have been + V-ing?"],"use":"Tổng thời gian kéo dài tính đến một mốc tương lai","signals":"for + khoảng thời gian + by / next…","ex":["Next year I'll have been teaching for 10 years.","Năm sau là tôi dạy học tròn 10 năm."]}],"backshift":{"point":"reported-statements","tenses":[["Present simple","Past simple","“I work here.”","She said she worked there."],["Present continuous","Past continuous","“I'm cooking.”","He said he was cooking."],["Present perfect","Past perfect","“I've finished.”","She said she had finished."],["Past simple","Past perfect","“I saw him.”","He said he had seen him."],["Past continuous","Past perfect continuous","“I was sleeping.”","She said she had been sleeping."],["will","would","“I'll help you.”","He said he would help me."],["can","could","“I can swim.”","She said she could swim."],["may","might","“I may be late.”","He said he might be late."],["must (bắt buộc)","had to / must","“I must go.”","She said she had to go."],["Past perfect · would · could · should · might","không đổi","“You should rest.”","He said I should rest."]],"words":[["now","then / at that time"],["today","that day"],["tonight","that night"],["yesterday","the day before / the previous day"],["tomorrow","the next day / the following day"],["last week","the week before / the previous week"],["next week","the following week / the week after"],["… ago","… before / … earlier"],["here","there"],["this / these","that / those"]]}}